            "type": "text",
            "text": "Foundation: chain 57 (multiple of 2 plus 1). Row 1 (WS): ch 3, draw up loop in 2nd and 3rd ch from hook and in next 3 ch (5 loops on hook), yo pull through all, ch 1 to close "
