            "text": "eye"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". * Insert in eye, next 4 ch; draw up 5 loops, close, ch 1. Repeat to end. Row 2 (RS): turn, ch 3, "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "star-st-cushion"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "star stitch"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " anchoring first two legs into last eye and right-side loops of previous row. Repeat rows 1 and 2 to 40 cm. Fasten off."
          }
        ]
      },
